$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $1$ |\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[Y\\,|\\,X=2] & =[{\\sum }_{y}{y}^{2}\\,{f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,2)]-{\\mu }_{Y|2}^{2} \\\\  & =[{0}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}+{2}^{2}\\cdot 0+{4}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}]-{1}^{2} \\\\  & =0+0+4-1 \\\\  & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542245 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186542262 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542245 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2efcbc03-ec16-5aa6-be91-e8353500b6fd" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542245 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186527937 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542251 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186542261 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542251 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "456c9817-f9b5-5e02-ad7e-aba7476b75ff" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542251 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186542114 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542261 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186542245 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542261 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "71644673-4b60-52c3-b90a-66ca26f88cd7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542261 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186542228 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542262 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "76632a42-7076-5678-bdc5-b59bab16ce2a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542262 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186542174 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542277 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186542251 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542277 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "ccfd8164-083c-5eef-a333-3dcb0ae83dcf" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186542277 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186188680 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
